5. How to maintain claim history in Silver
Suppose your Bronze contains both file versions. In Silver, use a business key such as ClaimId to decide which claims changed.

For current-state processing, you can use Delta MERGE:


MERGE INTO Silver.Claims AS target
USING Silver.Claims_Staging AS source
ON target.ClaimId = source.ClaimId

WHEN MATCHED AND
    NOT (target.Amount <=> source.Amount)
THEN UPDATE SET
    target.Amount = source.Amount,
    target.UpdatedAt = source.UpdatedAt

WHEN NOT MATCHED
THEN INSERT (
    ClaimId,
    Amount,
    UpdatedAt
)
VALUES (
    source.ClaimId,
    source.Amount,
    source.UpdatedAt
);


